WEBVTT

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:10.130
Hold it right there!

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:14.020
You have the right to remain silent 
and the right to an attorney!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.250
Veronica!

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.490
So you've shown your true colors!

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:27.780
Ninotchka!

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:28.580
Right!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.820
Hey! We didn't ask for backup!

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:41.850
I just happened to be passing by.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.520
You're not going to catch me!

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:52.480
Give it up. You're completely surrounded.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:53.890
You're here, too, Chief?

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:57.400
Oh, yeah. I just happened to be passing by.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:59.770
Damn it...

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:07.530
A loud noise?

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:09.920
<i>Spring.</i>

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.520
<i>I'm finally fitting in with my new class,</i>

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:12.730
It must be the neighbor's cat.

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.680
<i>so I think I'll be able to get by.</i>

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.600
<i>Or so I thought,</i>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.190
<i>at the time...</i>

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.650
<b>Chuta, the Voice, and the Qualifying Exam</b>

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:58.940
Shirobori Middle School

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:58.940
Huh? Something smells good?

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.070
Well, it is spring...

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:06.660
Kokonose? Who are you talking to?

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:09.950
I like the smell of freshly-washed clothes 
after they've been dried.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.160
Hey, Kokonose!

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:11.910
Yes, sir!

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:13.830
How long do you plan on 
talking to yourself?

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:13.830
There it is.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.030
I'm sorry!

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.490
Murmuring Chuta.

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:21.730
The school year's just begun, 
and you're already a hero.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.250
I can't believe you ignored 
Takegawa in social studies...

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:26.500
Let's stop talking about that.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.090
I mean, people wouldn't 
normally be able to do that.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:29.600
Seriously.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:33.360
Misuzu, isn't Kokonose-kun 
interesting and funny?

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.360
<i>Misuzu Sonokata.</i>

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:51.890
<i>I haven't talked to her once yet, 
but I bet her personality's really cute, too.</i>

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.080
Whoa, you're like a pro.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.670
Nothing less from the demon of home ec 
trained in the art of doing chores.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:03:59.430
You're exaggerating.

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.900
Um, Kokonose-kun...

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:07.500
The cooking club has a cooking contest 
coming up. Would you consider joining?

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.210
Huh? Me?

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:13.510
We've noticed how good you are, 
so we wanted to ask you.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.360
S-Sorry, but I'm gonna pass.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:27.160
Aw, he declined.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:30.870
I hear that's exactly why he 
doesn't have any friends.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.940
That's not true!

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:35.810
I'm not holding back or anything!

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:39.550
I just really don't want to do it! 
I have to help Auntie, anyway!

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.410
What? Is he talking to himself?

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.710
Crap...

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:52.990
<i>It's not like I want to talk to myself.</i>

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:58.900
<i>There's a reason that I seem to be in a daze 
or not hear what people are saying.</i>

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.280
It's a bad habit of yours, Chuta.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:04.090
<i>I hear this voice.</i>

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:05.870
You're negative and pessimistic.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:08.230
Don't you have any confidence, Chuta?

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:09.520
Mind your own business!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:14.400
<i>I've been hearing this voice
 for as long as I can remember,</i>

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.790
<i>and it only reverberates in my head.</i>

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:21.370
<i>When I was little, I thought 
that's how it was for everyone,</i>

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:23.290
<i>but apparently it's just me.</i>

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:28.240
<i>The conversations we have are usually idiotic, 
so I've never anyone else about it.</i>

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.860
<i>But because of this, I miss 
important things being said,</i>

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:35.360
<i>or I argue with the voice 
and get treated like some weirdo.</i>

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:39.700
I'm basically complicated like that.

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.920
That's exactly why you 
don't have any friends.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.150
I said, "Shut up!"

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.070
<i>If that were the extent of my troubles, 
it wouldn't be so bad, but...</i>

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:55.430
<i>But that's why I decided that I wouldn't 
cause anyone else any trouble.</i>

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.550
Chuta, I smell oil.

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:01.390
Well, we're in cooking class, 
so it shouldn't be a surprise.

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:02.790
Ow...

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.440
Saotome-sensei...

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:12.980
You have some nerve, wrestling each other 
in the hallway while I was gone, Tateyan, Uchida.

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.100
We're sorry.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.640
Come see me in the faculty room 
after school.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:18.960
Okay.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.430
It's Blob-Blob, Chuta!

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.020
Gladly.

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:23.470
Come on. You need to return to class, too.

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:24.560
Y-Yes, Ma'am.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:28.340
Blob-Blob! It's Blob-Blob!

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:30.250
Shut up, already!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:31.830
It's Blob-Blob, isn't it?

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:34.530
Don't you mean boing-boing?

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.730
<i>She heard me...?</i>

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:47.910
You're the worst kind of pervert.

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:49.920
Please die without leaving a trace.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:53.500
What— Die? Huh?

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:56.920
The words that come out of her mouth 
and her face don't match at all!

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:59.560
More importantly, was I just rejected?

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.330
D'oh, Chuta.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.900
<i>Couldn't it have just stayed 
as a one-sided crush?</i>

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.240
Hey!

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.060
Are you free today?

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:15.050
Saotome-chan is taking us to karaoke.

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:16.880
You're going with Saotome-sensei?

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.120
Do you wanna come?

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:21.830
Huh? Sorry, but I'm...

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.080
I see.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:23.870
Sorry.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:26.110
Chuta Kokonose, right?

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.260
You sure are interesting.

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:31.280
Well, show up if you change your mind.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:32.610
I'm Tateyan.

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.800
Thanks, Tateyan.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:38.500
See ya!

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:42.320
<i>Next, we have some news from overseas.</i>

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:49.020
<i>We have just found out that the next head 
of the Italian Mafia could be Japanese.</i>

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.980
<i>I live in a muffin shop.</i>

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.890
I'm home, Auntie.

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.940
Welcome home, Chuta!

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.330
Mimi seems to be in a good mood.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.350
<i>This is my aunt, Mimi.</i>

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:07.850
<i>She's a genius when it 
comes to making muffins,</i>

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:10.620
<i>but she's not all there 
when it comes to other chores.</i>

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:12.840
Say, Chuta.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:16.100
This is hard for me to say...

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:21.460
I was using them carefully, but the shop's 
dust rags have gotten frayed.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:24.480
<b>Freshly-baked 
Muffins</b>

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:24.470
Okay. I'll sew some new dust rags for you.

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:26.600
Thanks, Chuta!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:28.580
Well done, Chuta.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.070
I love you!

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:30.120
It's not a big deal.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:30.860
Huh?

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.410
Oh, it's nothing...

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:41.370
<b>Freshly-baked Muffins</b>

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:36.490
Oh, I have the dish I made in home ec, 
but do you want some?

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.630
Woohoo! Thanks!

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:41.500
I've been so busy that I haven't 
eaten lunch yet.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:44.620
So good!

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:50.150
Did something happen at school?

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:50.930
Huh?

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:53.590
Did you mess up again?

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.000
N-Nothing happened. Ow!

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:57.990
Are you okay?

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:59.740
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:05.560
<i>My aunt raised me on her own, 
after I lost my parents.</i>

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:08.330
<i>So I can't really hide anything from her.</i>

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.830
Someone's here.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.080
Please die without leaving a trace.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:20.020
She didn't have to say it like that...

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.650
That demon with an angel's face...

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:24.320
Chuta, someone's here.

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:27.290
But man... she's so cute.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.190
Changes in the target's particles confirmed.

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:32.000
Please go ahead with the transfer, chu!

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:34.160
So bright!

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.960
Bright! Bright!

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:36.630
Wh-What the...

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.450
Chuta, what is this?

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:40.700
I don't know, either!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.280
Ow...

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:45.640
This is a strange room.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:49.070
This room! It's a strange room, Chuta!

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:56.310
What's going on?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.810
Where are we?

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:03.090
There's something over there. 
Chuta, there's something over there.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:05.730
I got it, so be quiet already.

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:09.700
That kid keeps talking to himself. 
Did he hit his head?

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:13.870
Apparently, talking to himself has nothing
to do with being an Earthling.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:18.050
The Earthlings we know 
don't talk to themselves, either.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.470
All right, let's go, Chuta!

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:36.830
Huh?

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:39.340
What?

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:41.230
A cat! Their faces are triangles!

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.740
Huh?!

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.810
They're suspicious, Chuta.

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:47.800
Did we show up to some costume contest?

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:50.660
Oh, welcome, Chuta Kokonose.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:54.280
We're Space Police ēlDLIVE.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.500
Yoyosa!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:59.730
S-Space Police...?

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.580
My name is Laine Brick.

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:06.380
I'm the chief of this 
solar system's ēlDLIVE bureau.

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:12.920
So why was this boy chosen for ēlDLIVE?

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:18.340
Judging from his data, I don't see 
anything special about this Earthling.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:20.030
Please calm yourselves.

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:24.120
This was the consensus of Mothers.

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.280
I was chosen?

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:28.440
That's right.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:31.160
We, the personnel of ēlDLIVE,

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:34.570
recruit those who have the potential 
to become great police officers

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:39.410
by the consensus of the Mothers Computer 
that is distributed across the universe.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:43.060
And you were chosen 
by the Mothers Computer.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:44.600
Hang on a sec.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.480
This is all way too sudden.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:49.160
Where are we anyway?

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:53.830
This is the <i>Jeanrenoi-R</i>, 
this solar system's ēlDLIVE bureau.

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:55.180
Jeanreno...?

00:11:55.180 --> 00:12:00.130
Hm... It might be faster to show you, 
rather than explaining.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.440
Tonto, Riggs.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.250
Yoyosa!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.230
Huh?

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:09.910
Transfer to ejection block confirmed.

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.030
Um, what is this?

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:14.070
All right. Throw him out there.

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:15.280
Yoyosa!

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:18.630
The door is opening. It's opening! It's opening!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.630
Huh? It's opening?

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:23.170
There's something round behind us!

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:25.650
It's a planet! It's Earth, Chuta!

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:30.250
You're kidding!

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:42.070
<b>Chuta Kokonose</b>

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:44.700
That's amazing!

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:48.190
Turn around! You can see 
our awesome-looking bureau.

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:50.710
Whoa, a spaceship?!

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:53.110
It's a plastic model. Doesn't it look 
like a plastic model, Chuta?

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:57.830
Earthlings have such sloppy form.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.630
Whoa, a face!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.120
It looks like a crescent moon.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:03.130
Don't scare him, Méliès.

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:05.190
If you're scared, hang onto me.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:06.550
Eight tentacles?!

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.260
There're ten.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:11.570
There are many lifeforms 
living in this vast universe.

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:17.680
Protecting the citizens 
and public order of the universe...

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:22.070
That's our mission as the Space Police ēlDLIVE.

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.350
The Chief nailed it.

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:26.360
He can say such cheesy lines so boldly...

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.950
Anyway! As long as you pass the 
qualifying exam that I'm about to give you,

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:33.250
you'll be an official member 
of ēlDLIVE, kid.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.890
Huh?! "Kid"?

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.750
Hang on a second! I never agreed to this!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.620
Don't worry about it! Actually, just do it.

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:42.150
Is that an order?

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.050
Take the test, Chuta.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:43.560
Huh?

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:47.180
Try to join ēlDLIVE. 
It seems fun! Definitely do it!

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:49.630
Shut up! You shut your mouth!

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:52.770
You really do talk to yourself a lot.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:53.850
<i>Um...</i>

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:56.840
<i>I can't.</i>

00:13:56.840 --> 00:14:00.480
Aw, come on!

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.960
I can't.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:04.340
I see. Well, this isn't good.

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:06.460
What should we tell the higher-ups?

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:11.970
Chief, what if by some insane coincidence, 
there was a mechanical failure...

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.850
Oho, I see.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:16.520
If the oxygen in his spacesuit 
just happens to get depleted,

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:17.850
Yup, yup.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:21.640
and he's unable to take the qualifying exam, 
we won't get in trouble with the higher-ups.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:23.750
Um, I can hear everything you're saying!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.500
I can't agree to this.

00:14:25.940 --> 00:14:28.050
<i>As you can see from 
his habit of talking to himself,</i>

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.600
<i>he suffers from delusions.</i>

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:31.090
I know this voice.

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:33.650
<i>And apparently he has no hesitations 
in voicing these delusions.</i>

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.930
<i>His embarrassment level is 
ten times higher than the average</i>

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:38.140
<i>for middle school students 
across the country.</i>

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:40.930
<i>I believe it's only a matter of time 
before his existence itself</i>

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:43.740
<i>is subject to the Prefectural 
Ordinance of Juvenile Protection.</i>

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:46.850
I don't know who you are, 
but stop blabbing about me!

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:48.400
Blabbing?

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.290
You don't know anything about me.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:54.570
We won't know I can't do it 
if I don't even try!

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:57.060
I see! So you'll do it!

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.620
I welcome passionate young men like yourself!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.410
And there you go.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:07.370
I just sort of went with the flow 
and said I'd do this, but...

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:10.030
The qualifying exam seems fun!

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:14.170
You're going to arrest a 
C-rank criminal alien from

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:17.230
the planet Chabrol that's 
hiding on Earth with these.

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:19.350
If you do, you'll pass the exam.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.310
Handcuffs? Will it cause a fuss?

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:27.610
Hm... Well, it is a predatory alien, 
so it might eat you if you're not careful.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:28.600
What?!

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:29.390
Sheronimo.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:30.970
Leave it to me, shero.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:32.910
SPH radiation.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:36.210
Changes in the target's particles confirmed.

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:35.620
By the way, I never asked where I was going.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.590
Bright!

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:38.090
Starting transfer.

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:37.840
Where am I going?

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.030
Bright!

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.960
Ow!

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:47.000
Where am I?

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.680
This is the third block of Keiki Town.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:50.920
Oh, yeah.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:54.380
This is right by my house. 
Could the criminal be here?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:58.820
Isn't it funny that there was 
an alien this close, Chuta?

00:15:58.820 --> 00:16:00.210
No, it's not.

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.660
Let's hurry up and find the alien, Chuta.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.100
You say that,

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:05.940
but how?

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:13.760
Now everyone's starting 
to look like an alien.

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.010
Hm...

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:21.510
Why was he chosen by Mothers?

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:22.970
Oh?

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:24.700
What is it, Harry?

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:26.540
It's about Chuta Kokonose...

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:31.460
His thermographic readings 
are a bit strange for an Earthling...

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.460
Strange?

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:35.630
This part right here that's 
slightly higher than the rest...

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:37.800
It's moving across the surface of his body.

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:46.260
Are there really aliens?

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:49.390
Oil! I smell oil, Chuta!

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.770
I don't smell it.

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:54.860
Oh, if it isn't Kokonose-kun...

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:57.250
Oh, Chuta.

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.710
Oh, hello.

00:16:58.710 --> 00:16:59.900
Blob-Blob.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:03.170
Um... Are you coming back from karaoke?

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:07.230
It's pretty late, so I'm making sure 
Tateyan gets back safely.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:08.580
Isn't it great?

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:11.140
I see...

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:13.420
Blob-Blob smells like oil!

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.220
I told you, I don't smell any oil.

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:20.360
Could you be talking about me?

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.850
No, not at all...

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:26.300
Well, yeah. Saotome-chan 
smells much better than that.

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:30.590
Smell? Is he talking about SPH?

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:36.020
That's inconceivable. Earthlings 
don't have the ability to sense SPH.

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:40.770
Chuta, I smell oil from Blob-Blob. 
Blob-Blob smells like oil.

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:45.050
Shut up! I'm telling you, 
nothing smells like oil!

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:48.590
Also, it's not Blob-Blob...

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:53.590
Who... Who are you calling Blob-Blob?

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:55.210
Saotome-chan?

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:56.840
Sensei?

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:06.430
I can't stand being called "Blob-Blob." 
It's even worse than missing a meal!

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:14.150
It's the Chabrolian!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.110
He found the criminal!

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:17.430
Oh?

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.280
Ugh, how did you find me out?

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:24.470
It really was a Blob-Blob, huh, Chuta?

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:26.660
Actually, I'd say it's more Chub-Chub.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:29.500
Don't be so rude!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:33.170
That's an ēlDLIVE badge!

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:35.980
You're not going to catch me!

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:39.120
Come any closer, and I'll kill this brat!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:40.840
Tateyan!

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:44.050
H-Help me, Chuta.

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:48.780
Help me, Chuta!

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:52.330
Help me!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:53.810
I'll save you!

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:55.440
Chuta, the rock on the right...

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.720
The right? Got it!

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:58.870
No, that one's dangerous!

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.670
Something bad's going to happen again...

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.650
You always say that, Chuta.

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:07.520
See! This is exactly why!

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:11.570
Someone like me, who keeps hearing 
this weird voice is absolutely useless!

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:13.740
I'll never be able to be a police officer!

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:17.230
If you understand, 
get lost already, ēlDLIVE!

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:20.400
Wait, Chuta! You're the only one!

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:24.360
Please! Help me, Chuta!

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:27.760
I'm the only one who can save him?

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.140
Shut up!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:33.430
Tateyan...

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:34.890
This isn't good.

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:37.380
At this rate, it's going to get us, Chuta.

00:19:39.430 --> 00:19:40.810
I guess this is the end...

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:47.470
<i>If I do something, something bad will happen.</i>

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:52.080
<i>That's why, as much as possible, I tried 
not to get involved with the people around me.</i>

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:53.780
<i>But...</i>

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:56.080
Well, show up if you change your mind.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:56.870
I'm Tateyan.

00:19:58.080 --> 00:20:02.540
<i>Tateyan, who talked to me despite 
how I am, is asking me for help.</i>

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:05.750
We should fall back for now.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:09.180
Can't I save him somehow?

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.350
Chuta?

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:13.030
You're a part of me,

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:15.300
so help me think of a way to save Tateyan!

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.460
What did you just say, Chuta?

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:20.480
Shut up, and think with me!

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:24.280
I'm the only one here! 
I'm going to save Tateyan!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.290
With you?

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:31.280
This is strange, Chuta. It's a new sensation.

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:35.240
Chuta Kokonose's SPH level is rising.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.240
Stop! Let go of Tateyan!

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:40.790
Come on. He's gonna snap in half.

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.000
Stop!

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.210
Come on...

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:45.470
Stop!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.630
Sympathy!

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:59.480
It's been a while since my symbiotic 
technique has been activated.

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:00.470
Huh?

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:05.890
Wh-What is this?

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:10.640
The symbol on its forehead 
belongs to the Lost Griffith.

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:15.160
There's only one way we'd 
see something like that on Earth...

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:16.850
A Monitalien!

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:22.950
Monitaliens are organisms sent across 
various planets to observe those planets

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:27.340
by the inhabitants of Griffith, 
which flourished over four billion years ago.

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:32.180
You have a stupid look 
on your face right now, Chuta.

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:33.600
No way!

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:34.680
You can see me?

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:37.180
Yeah, I can see you! So the voice 
that's been talking to me all this time...

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:38.430
We'll talk later, Chuta.

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:40.480
The Blob-Blob's gonna wake up.

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:45.640
I don't know what you just did, 
but you're not going to get away with it!

00:21:51.940 --> 00:21:53.740
You're not getting away!

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:55.320
Crap! Crap!

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:57.600
Imagine it, Chuta.

00:21:57.600 --> 00:22:00.950
Any joint action we take 
begins as soon as you picture it.

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:02.460
Picture?

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:04.700
I'll get you this time!

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:08.140
It's coming!

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:11.210
Look at that thing's body, 
and imagine how to beat it.

00:22:11.210 --> 00:22:12.040
Huh?

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:17.030
That thing's body is all flabby and loose...

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:21.060
What if we stitched up its body like a rag?

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:22.780
Sympathy!

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:35.700
I can't breathe!

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:41.200
The handcuffs, Chuta!

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:42.150
Wh-What...

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:49.230
What are you?

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:56.260
A Monitalien that evolved and a special Earthling 
that is able to bring forth its power...

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.130
How interesting...

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:00.820
Ow!

00:23:01.760 --> 00:23:03.310
Chuta Kokonose!

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:06.570
You pass the ēlDLIVE qualifying exam!

00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:09.480
I pass?

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:12.070
I'm against this.

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:19.990
Wh-What's...

00:23:19.990 --> 00:23:22.440
Misuzu Sonokata doing here?!

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:27.910
The sewing really worked, Chuta.

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:28.460
Yeah.

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:31.140
But couldn't you come up 
with a cooler attack name?

00:23:31.140 --> 00:23:33.210
Huh? The sewing wasn't cool?

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:33.590
Huh?

00:23:33.630 --> 00:23:34.150
Huh?

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:35.670
Next time on <i>ēlDLIVE,</i>

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:37.870
"Super Cool Space Girl."

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:40.050
<b>Next Time
Super Cool Space Girl</b>

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:40.170
Sorry, I'm going to pretend 
I didn't hear that.
